---
title: Caramel Frappuccino
servings: 2
time required: 5 minutes
course: Drink
cuisine: American
source: https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/235850/starbucks-caramel-frappuccino-copycat-recipe/
image: https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U7mhD0uSRFWBeFQYnIXNQbPUWcs=/750x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235850-starbucks-caramel-frappuccino-copycat-recipe-DDMFS-4x3-227a1e47f46643dcb4708e775a250bca.jpg
---

In a #blender, blend together @ice{2%cups}, @coffee{1%cup}(cooled), @milk{1%cup}, @caramel sauce{1/3%cup}, and @white sugar{3%tbsp} until smooth. Top with @?caramel sauce{} and @?whip cream{} as desired.